{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Yapori Minigames is a singleplayer game with several minigames, different game modes, several playable characters and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several different minigames and challenges, such as the asteroid minigame, where you have to dodge asteroids until time runs out, the soccer minigame, where you have to score a specific number of goals before time runs out to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5 skins to unlock, such as Darkpori, a fox with a white scarf and blue shoes, Aybo who is an intelligent and somewhat annoying robot, Jack a crazy yellow monkey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes that vary in different gameplay, such as Music Mode and Platform Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634720?t=1745271042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634720/404d1109ddf030c724133e859d915a40e0cf1783/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745271042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634720/736420ba90c1cdce82f29d309a5263914b09607d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745271042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634720/736420ba90c1cdce82f29d309a5263914b09607d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745271042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Yapori Minigames is a singleplayer game with several minigames, different game modes, several playable characters and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several different minigames and challenges, such as the asteroid minigame, where you have to dodge asteroids until time runs out, the soccer minigame, where you have to score a specific number of goals before time runs out to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 5 skins to unlock, such as Darkpori, a fox with a white scarf and blue shoes, Aybo who is an intelligent and somewhat annoying robot, Jack a crazy yellow monkey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes that vary in different gameplay, such as Music Mode and Platform Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more!</p>","developers":["Hayllon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634720/df772f6b3398733d7c19a9e73896c4e3eb970cdb/header.jpg?t=1745271042","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121548,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121548/movie480.mp4?t=1743638201","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121548/movie_max.mp4?t=1743638201"},"name":"Trailer Oficial","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121548/a5df1952d945890f2aec78ad003e2bc2d52d532e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743638201","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121548/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743638201","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121548/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743638201"}}],"name":"Super Yapori Minigames","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 180 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended"